      "synthesis": {
        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "4 mL MeOH was added to a mixture of Dy(NO3)3·5H2O (228.3 mg, 0.5 mmol) and Mn(OAc)2·4H2O (73.5 mg, 0.3 mmol); H4thmmg (35.8 mg, 0.2 mmol) and NaCl (29.22 mg, 0.5 mmol) were dissolved in H2O (1 mL). The solutions were combined in a 10 mL glass bottle at room temperature, transferred to an ultrasound machine, and 40 μL Et3N was slowly added. The bottle was kept at 65 °C for about 5 days, giving colorless block crystals of 1.",
